This is the final integration milestone. There is nothing to implement.

Load your complete module with the key parameter and run through every
command, both locally (mkdir) and remotely (operator tool). If any command
fails, go back to the lesson that introduced it.

Common issues:
- Module not loading: check that all object files are listed in Kbuild
- Encryption failures: verify the key matches between insmod and operator
- Port hiding not working remotely: the remote command must map to the
  same internal function as the mkdir command
- Kernel fault on unload: check teardown order (unhide module, stop
  listener, unregister probes)
